OL,3,GNEWSAJudge's exhibition shines light on
OL,4,Aroller skating
OL,5,
OL,6,FA national roller skating judge and
OL,7,Fphotographer, who has captured the
OL,8,Flives of seven artistic skaters over 10
OL,9,Fyears, hopes her exhibition can shine a
OL,10,Fspotlight on the sport - and wishes
OL,11,Fthat one day it will be in the
OL,12,FOlympics.
OL,14,FDebby Besford grew up in Great
OL,15,FYarmouth, Norfolk, which has a strong
OL,16,Froller skating heritage, and travelled
OL,17,Fall over the country to compete.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
