OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAJudge's exhibition shines light on
OL,4,Aroller skating
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhile flicking through photo albums on
OL,7,Fa visit to her parents and reminiscing
OL,8,Fover her skating days, she decided it
OL,9,Fwould be "fantastic" to do an
OL,10,Fexhibition about young skaters from the
OL,11,Ftown's Retro Skating Academy.
OL,13,FShe said it was "amazing" to see how
OL,14,Fskating had shaped their lives during
OL,15,Fthe decade.
